{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a single-player linear plot game, currently still in active development and updates.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If you have any questions, please join our DISCORD or other social media links and contact us promptly!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/978176d17550bb07e8a7c9ad855e9a02.poster.avif?t=1773939709\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/978176d17550bb07e8a7c9ad855e9a02.webm?t=1773939709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake up from a car crash, you find yourself trapped in an incomprehensible liminal space. Here, you will take on the role of an ordinary person named &quot;Josh&quot; \u2014 navigate this ever-changing world to recover your past memories, master the &quot;rules of each space&quot;, and fight to survive. You will encounter not only a variety of landscapes and unique environments, but also ferocious and dangerous hostile entities, or even the &quot;Old Gods&quot; hiding in the depths, harassing your nerves every moment. Accept or refuse, escape or resist \u2014 choose carefully! Your decisions will determine not only your own fate, but also who will control the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/9b3141c9984a4e95cf8dc932040cc208.poster.avif?t=1773939709\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/9b3141c9984a4e95cf8dc932040cc208.webm?t=1773939709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/9b3141c9984a4e95cf8dc932040cc208.mp4?t=1773939709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/03359b77483ba8aef8b7b0c36e0d70ba.avif?t=1773939709\" width=1400 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/b463ae31ed7ce0a984ae4275389b85c6.poster.avif?t=1773939709\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/b463ae31ed7ce0a984ae4275389b85c6.webm?t=1773939709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/b463ae31ed7ce0a984ae4275389b85c6.mp4?t=1773939709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0This world is filled with extraordinary spaces. One moment you might be wandering through a dilapidated budget hotel, and the next, walking through a corridor will take you into an ancient 17th-century library. A deserted yet eerie 1990s office, a cold yet serene winter village in Northeast China, your childhood community from the 2000s, or even a brutal concrete prison factory where you will face the &quot;Old Gods&quot; head-on... Experience all of these for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/0094d7cf02945ee4094755a44240c79d.avif?t=1773939709\" width=1400 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/0ebd9a6f4b6327a8f0c50adaf9944eaf.poster.avif?t=1773939709\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/0ebd9a6f4b6327a8f0c50adaf9944eaf.webm?t=1773939709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/0ebd9a6f4b6327a8f0c50adaf9944eaf.mp4?t=1773939709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Josh, you fell into a coma after a car crash and woke up in this incomprehensible liminal space. Feel the joy of hearing a &quot;living voice&quot; for the first time in the vast snowfield, the pain of regaining fragments of memory when finding your friend\u2019s body buried in the snow, and the longing when stepping into an unknown yet warm world. The ups and downs of emotion will unfold gradually through every piece of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/3a48397fe217eae20a5d3ad4aeca4807.avif?t=1773939709\" width=1400 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/c2891fe2852f43782967286368b59a26.poster.avif?t=1773939709\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/c2891fe2852f43782967286368b59a26.webm?t=1773939709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/c2891fe2852f43782967286368b59a26.mp4?t=1773939709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil TV monsters wandering the office, &quot;cute&quot; snowmen hiding in the night of the snow village, or even the &quot;mastermind&quot; lurking in the shadows \u2014 remember, if you don\u2019t have a sure chance of winning, always keep your distance from them! Any carelessness will lead to irreversible consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491960?t=1773939709","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/35781cd0fc2e40b027c154ee7b2a71c810f5ce8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773939709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/5d774dbf5002e3e4bc1f175aea0c47493e1c51e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773939709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/5d774dbf5002e3e4bc1f175aea0c47493e1c51e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773939709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a single-player linear plot game, currently still in active development and updates.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 